# Widget description

the FUW (File Upload Wizard) widget is a Vue widget that integrates Uppy to allow users to upload large files

# Rules

- Use Vue 2.7 for Vue components
- Follow standard Vue component-based development practices
- Keep Vue components modular and self-contained, preferably in single file components
- Use the vue Options API